zj/thumb/a/a5/gn81uxlhdba2j5cg2og0yimdhhzth40.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3%E5%89%91%E7%BA%B9.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a5/gn81uxlhdba2j5cg2og0yimdhhzth40.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3%E5%89%91%E7%BA%B9.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a5/gn81uxlhdba2j5cg2og0yimdhhzth40.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />回音剑纹\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（抉择）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">回音剑纹</span>]。剑纹效果：<br />✦跳过[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"连招蓄势\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">连招蓄势</font></span></span>]的准备阶段后，将再次十触发相同的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"连招蓄势\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">连招蓄势</font></span></span>]，可触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次，行动开始时重置限次。<br />✦释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"圣剑术\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">圣剑术</font></span></span>]技能时，不再发动主动效果，并跳过当次[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"连招蓄势\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">连招蓄势</font></span></span>]的准备阶段。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:80px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"圣剑铭刻\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%9C%A3%E5%89%91%E9%93%AD%E5%88%BB\" title=\"技能图鉴库/圣剑铭刻\"><img alt=\"技能背景 传说.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki